{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710880/extras/3__2_.png?t=1748016363\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Supporter Pack</strong> provides bonus content for those who want to support the developers of <i>Tinkerlands</i> beyond just buying the game itself. It includes fun extras, such as:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Original Soundtrack</strong><br>Get the <i>Tinkerlands</i> OST as a digital download and enjoy the game\u2019s music anytime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd80 <strong>Tinker-Crab Summon</strong><br>Summon your very own Tinker-Crab, a unique companion found in your starting chest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Crab Pickaxe &amp; Axe</strong><br>Crab-themed tool recipes added to your starting chest\u2014bring extra style to your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Crab Armor Set</strong><br>A full crab armor set waiting in your starting chest. Look cool while you survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thank you for your support!\u00a0</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3710880?t=1748016363","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710880/b32e7dd7cc631cd000a1b994574e958412ceb558/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748016363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710880/f03473b75a93a13095705b0fe1e4ff3837be4b99/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748016363","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710880/f03473b75a93a13095705b0fe1e4ff3837be4b99/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748016363","categories":[{"description":"Sin